---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import dir from "@images/dir.svg";
import cpu from "@images/cpu.webp";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import DedicatedProducts from "@components/DedicatedProducts.svelte";
import Features from "@components/Features.svelte";
---

<Layout
  title="EvosHosting - Dedicated Servers for all your needs"
  description="Get powerful and reliable dedicated servers for all your hosting needs. Experience maximum performance, customization, and security with our dedicated server solutions."
>
  <div
    class="relative mb-20 flex flex-col items-center justify-between px-3 py-14 md:flex-row md:p-12"
  >
    <div
      class="text-gradient -z-40 hidden font-extrabold md:absolute md:block md:text-md-xl"
    >
      Dedicated
    </div>
    <div class="absolute left-4 top-0 z-10 md:flex md:w-1/4 md:justify-center">
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <Image
          src={dir}
          alt="cloud"
          class="h-11 w-11 rotate-3 animate-fade-right md:h-28 md:w-28"
        />
        <Image
          src={dir}
          alt="cloud"
          class="ml-10 h-8 w-8 -rotate-3 animate-fade-right blur-xs md:ml-32 md:h-14 md:w-14 md:blur-0"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex-col justify-center space-y-4 overflow-hidden md:order-2 md:flex md:w-full md:space-y-8"
    >
      <h1 class="text-center text-7xl font-extrabold md:text-7xl">Dedicated</h1>

      <p
        class="text-balance text-center text-sm font-bold text-primary md:text-2xl"
      >
        Dedicated Servers
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute right-4 top-44 z-10 md:right-0 md:top-0 md:order-3 md:flex md:w-1/4 md:flex-col md:justify-center"
    >
      <Image
        src={cpu}
        alt="cpu"
        class="ml-24 h-11 w-11 rotate-3 animate-fade-left md:h-28 md:w-28 md:blur-0"
      />
      <Image
        src={cpu}
        alt="cpu"
        class="ml-10 h-8 w-8 -rotate-3 animate-fade-left shadow-primary blur-xs md:h-14 md:w-14 md:blur-0"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-pattern2">
    <div class="mt-20 space-y-6 px-8 pb-20 md:px-16">
      <DedicatedProducts client:load />

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-4 md:grid-cols-3"></div>
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-dark/50 p-5 text-center text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl"
      >
        <span class="text-primary">Delivery in 1-7 working days</span>, subject
        to availability. <br />
        Contact us to request a custom plan.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">
        Dedicated vs AMD Ryzen VPS
      </h3>
      <h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-white">What’s the Difference?</h2>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex flex-col justify-between space-y-5 p-10 md:flex-row md:space-x-5 md:space-y-0"
    >
      <div class="md:max-w-[47%]">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold">Dedicated</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center space-y-2">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-2 text-lg font-bold">PERFORMANCE</span>
            <div class="h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-primary/20">
              <div class="h-3 rounded-full bg-primary" style={`width: 100%`}>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-y-2">
          <span class="mr-2 mt-2 text-lg font-bold">CUSTOMIZATION</span>
          <div class="h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-primary/20">
            <div class="h-3 rounded-full bg-primary" style={`width: 100%`}>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-y-2">
          <span class="mr-2 mt-2 text-lg font-bold">PRICE</span>
          <div class="h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-primary/20">
            <div class="h-3 rounded-full bg-primary" style={`width: 80%`}></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-5">
          <div class="space-y-2 py-1.5">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Performance</h3>
            <p class="text-balance">
              With a dedicated server, the hardware resources are entirely
              available to a single user, ensuring maximum performance without
              the risk of congestion caused by other users. This is ideal for
              resource-intensive applications.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2 py-1.5">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Customization</h3>
            <p class="text-balance">
              Customization on a dedicated server is total. The user can
              configure every aspect of the server, from the operating system to
              the installed software, tailoring the work environment to their
              specific needs.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2 py-1.5">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Price</h3>
            <p class="text-balance">
              Dedicated servers tend to be more expensive than VPS, as the user
              is paying for exclusive access to the server's hardware. However,
              the investment is justified by the performance and security
              offered.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-4">
        <div class="h-1.5 w-full rounded-full bg-primary/20 md:h-64 md:w-1.5">
        </div>
        <span class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white/40">VS</span>
        <div class="h-1.5 w-full rounded-full bg-primary/20 md:h-64 md:w-1.5">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:max-w-[47%]">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold">VPS</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center space-y-2">
            <span class="mr-2 mt-2 text-lg font-bold">PERFORMANCE</span>
            <div class="h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-primary/20">
              <div class="h-3 rounded-full bg-primary" style={`width: 50%`}>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-y-2">
          <span class="mr-2 mt-2 text-lg font-bold">CUSTOMIZATION</span>
          <div class="h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-primary/20">
            <div class="h-3 rounded-full bg-primary" style={`width: 40%`}></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-y-2">
          <span class="mr-2 mt-2 text-lg font-bold">PRICE</span>
          <div class="h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-primary/20">
            <div class="h-3 rounded-full bg-primary" style={`width: 20%`}></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-5">
          <div class="space-y-2 py-1.5">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Performance</h3>
            <p class="text-balance">
              VDS Performance servers offer dedicated and guaranteed hardware
              resources, ensuring excellent performance for more demanding
              applications. With the latest generation processors, these VDS are
              ideal for intensive workloads.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2 py-1.5">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Customization</h3>
            <p class="text-balance">
              A VDS Performance allows for advanced customization, enabling
              users to configure the operating system and software according to
              their needs. Resource management is simple and intuitive through
              advanced control panels.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2 py-1.5">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Price</h3>
            <p class="text-balance">
              The cost of a VDS Performance is higher than that of a cheap VDS,
              reflecting the superior quality of the hardware and guaranteed
              performance. However, it is a worthwhile investment for those who
              need high performance and reliability.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="px-4 py-4">
      <Features client:load />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .text-gradient {
    background-image: linear-gradient(to top, #011018 0%, #032e44 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
</style>
